1
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:05,740
我之前看了一部电影预告
Hey, so I saw a movie trailer the other day.

2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:07,930
蝙蝠侠怎么可能打得过超人呢
How could Batman possibly fight Superman?

3
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:09,390
真是瞎透了
I mean, isn't that dumb?

4
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:10,830
或许他用了氪气石
Maybe he uses Kryptonite.

5
00:00:09,390 --> 00:00:12,340
来自超人故乡氪星的一种矿物
有令氪星人失去超能力等多种功效

6
00:00:10,830 --> 00:00:12,340
蝙蝠侠超有钱
Well, Batman's got a lot of money.

7
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:15,530
或许他用钱打造出具有类似超人能力的装甲
Maybe he builds a suit that can do everything Superman can do.

8
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:16,280
不不不不不
No, no, no, no, no.

9
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:18,810
这样的电影我看过  叫《钢铁侠》
I've seen that movie. It's called Iron Man.

10
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,820
怎么回事
What is happening?

11
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:30,310
我不知道
I don't know.

12
00:00:31,130 --> 00:00:34,020
但这画面太美了
But it's beautiful.

13
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:36,280
而且蝙蝠侠换本·阿弗莱克演了
And now Ben Affleck is Batman?

14
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:38,330
他在《恋爱中的莎士比亚》那部里演得很棒
Oh, he was great in Shakespeare in Love.

15
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,870
我们下次闺蜜之夜应该来看这部
Ooh, we should watch that next girls' night.

16
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:40,960
我们可以再配上
We could do a double feature

17
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:43,200
莱昂纳多的《罗密欧与朱丽叶》啊
with the Leonardo DiCaprio Romeo + Juliet.

18
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:44,880
我可乐意看小李子了
Oh, I love me some Leo.

19
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:46,570
美景消失了
And it's gone.

20
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:49,540
大家安安
Oh, hello, everyone.

21
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:52,950
很开心跟大家宣布本皇龙体已有好转
I am happy to report I'm feeling much better.

22
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:53,790
"恭喜"
Good for you.

23
00:00:55,020 --> 00:00:57,900
发烧已退  鼻子也通
My fever is gone, my sinuses are pressure-free,

24
00:00:57,900 --> 00:01:01,880
痰也清澈得像国家公园里的瀑布水一样
and my mucus is as clear as a Yosemite waterfall.

25
00:01:02,910 --> 00:01:04,610
"棒呆了"
Glad to hear it.

26
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:08,710
明日我就能回归工作岗位了
I'll be able to return to work tomorrow.

27
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:11,020
"赞"
Yay.

28
00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:15,130
大家怎么都不开心呢
Well, why isn't everyone happy?

29
00:01:15,130 --> 00:01:18,570
你们的小太阳准备重新发光发热啦
Your little ray of sunshine is ready to beam again.

30
00:01:19,520 --> 00:01:21,770
-你真的不知道为什么吗  -不知道
- You really don't know why? - No.

31
00:01:21,770 --> 00:01:24,170
但我听出他那声"赞"是在讽刺
But I knew that his "yay" was sarcastic.

32
00:01:24,170 --> 00:01:26,190
上次出恭时  声响犹如雨打芭蕉的这位
Not bad for a guy whose last bowel movement

33
00:01:26,190 --> 00:01:28,360
居然还有体力讽刺  不赖嘛
sounded like rain on a roof.

34
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:32,930
让我帮忙你回忆一下
Let me refresh your memory.

35
00:01:34,620 --> 00:01:35,810
佩妮
Penny,

36
00:01:35,810 --> 00:01:38,230
帮我在胸口抹清凉油
rub Vicks on my chest.

37
00:01:38,720 --> 00:01:40,980
谢尔顿  我给你做了早饭
Sheldon, I cooked you breakfast.

38
00:01:40,980 --> 00:01:42,010
铺了床
I made your bed.

39
00:01:42,010 --> 00:01:45,710
检查你嘴里有没有鹅口疮
I checked your mouth for thrush.

40
00:01:42,010 --> 00:01:45,710
一种口腔黏膜炎症

41
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:47,590
清凉油你可以自己抹
You can rub your own chest.

42
00:01:48,020 --> 00:01:50,070
行行行  世上的男人 你都没少摸过
Oh, sure, grope every other male on the planet,

43
00:01:50,070 --> 00:01:51,800
到我这儿就装清纯
but draw the line with me.

44
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:56,040
我从公司给你准备了这个康复小袋袋
I brought you a little care package from work.

45
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:57,480
里面有我们最新的抗病毒药
It's our latest antiviral

46
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,320
还有我们最好的抗鼻塞药
and the best decongestant we make.

47
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:01,790
那我希望笑是最好的药物
I hope laughter is the best medicine,

48
00:02:01,790 --> 00:02:04,390
因为这包东西根本就是在搞笑
'cause this care package is a joke.

49
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,150
她大老远特意跑来...
Hey, she came all the way here...

50
00:02:12,950 --> 00:02:15,170
你记得饭后再吃啊
You're gonna want to take these with food.

51
00:02:17,870 --> 00:02:20,040
谢尔顿  别孩子气了
Sheldon, stop being a baby

52
00:02:20,040 --> 00:02:21,900
让艾米丽给你看看嘛
and let Emily take a look at you.

53
00:02:21,900 --> 00:02:23,990
她是皮肤科医生
She's a dermatologist.

54
00:02:23,990 --> 00:02:25,980
我上过医学院啊
I went to medical school.

55
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:28,600
这样的话  那请你把位于你旁边的
Well, in that case, try removing the irritating patch

56
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:32,040
那坨烦人棕色皮肤给去除掉
of brown skin standing next to you.

57
00:02:34,530 --> 00:02:36,870
来  吃吧
All right, here you go.

58
00:02:37,460 --> 00:02:39,240
莱纳德  我要死了
Leonard, I'm dying.

59
00:02:39,580 --> 00:02:41,770
你才不会死  只是流感而已
You're not dying. It's just the flu.

60
00:02:41,770 --> 00:02:43,050
我要的是鸡汤面
I asked for chicken noodle.

61
00:02:43,050 --> 00:02:46,410
这个是鸡与星星状的面  我要气死了
This is chicken and stars. It's killing me.

62
00:02:49,540 --> 00:02:52,250
我最终还是没吃到鸡汤面不是吗
I never did get that chicken noodle, did I?

63
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,900
生

64
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,900
活

65
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,900
大

66
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,900
爆

67
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,900
炸

68
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:12,900
第九季  第十三集

69
00:03:21,180 --> 00:03:22,290
谢尔顿
Hi, Sheldon.

70
00:03:22,290 --> 00:03:23,220
你好啊
Hello.

71
00:03:23,220 --> 00:03:25,210
你身体好点了吗
Are you feeling any better?

72
00:03:25,210 --> 00:03:27,540
生理上好点了  但心里不太好
Physically, yes, but I'm upset

73
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:30,440
因为大家莫名其妙就不爽我
because everyone's mad at me for no good reason.

74
00:03:32,040 --> 00:03:33,680
你跟我说说发生了什么吧
Why don't you tell me what happened,

75
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,710
然后我会用温和  慈爱的方式
and in a gentle, loving way,

76
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:38,010
来跟你解释你为什么错了
I'll explain to you why you're wrong.

77
00:03:39,390 --> 00:03:41,080
你知道当人生病的时候
You know how, when you're sick,

78
00:03:41,080 --> 00:03:44,320
是有权对身旁或任何人耍脾气
you're allowed to be cranky and say whatever you want

79
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,740
而且完全不用鸟他们感受的吧
and other people's feelings don't matter?

80
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:51,520
温和慈爱  这有点费劲啊
Gentle and loving-- this is gonna be tricky.

81
00:03:52,340 --> 00:03:54,210
我都烧到38.3度了
I had a 101 fever.

82
00:03:54,210 --> 00:03:58,320
此时不尖酸刻薄对亲朋好友  更待何时
If that's not a time to verbally abuse my loved ones, when is?

83
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:02,640
谢尔顿  当你生病的时候  你会有点...
Sheldon, when you're sick, you can be...

84
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:04,750
让人受不了
unbearable.

85
00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:06,700
所以你的小伙伴们
That's why your friends have been known

86
00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:10,210
要么加班  要么溜去看电影
to work late or sneak out to the movies

87
00:04:10,210 --> 00:04:12,550
或者多留在神经生物学大会
or stay at a neurobiology conference

88
00:04:12,550 --> 00:04:14,970
哪怕大会三天前就结束了
three days after it's ended.

89
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:18,790
你多留在密歇根就是为了要躲我吗
You stayed in Michigan all week to avoid being around me?

90
00:04:18,790 --> 00:04:20,610
不是不是  不止如此
No, no, not just that.

91
00:04:20,610 --> 00:04:21,780
还有...
I mean...

92
00:04:21,780 --> 00:04:25,490
底特律下雨夹雪的时候特美呢
Detroit is beautiful when it's sleeting.

93
00:04:26,470 --> 00:04:27,910
又不是只有我一个人生病时
You know, I'm not the only one

94
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:29,400
才这么讨人厌
who's unpleasant when they're sick.

95
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:32,090
像佩妮食物中毒的那次  她呕吐声大到
When Penny got food poisoning, she threw up so loudly

96
00:04:32,090 --> 00:04:34,370
我都听不到电视的声音了
I could barely hear the television.

97
00:04:35,330 --> 00:04:36,950
我好像听到了什么声音
Ooh, I just heard something.

98
00:04:36,950 --> 00:04:38,560
不知道是冰雹声还是枪声
Might be hail, might be gunfire.

99
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,790
反正我都要去拍照围观啦  再见
Either way, I'm gonna go take pictures. Bye.

100
00:04:43,740 --> 00:04:44,500
斯图尔特
Hey, Stuart.

101
00:04:44,500 --> 00:04:46,520
谢尔顿呢
Hey. Where's Sheldon?

102
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:48,060
-还病着呢  -没  已经好了
- Still sick? - No, he's fine.

103
00:04:48,060 --> 00:04:49,930
我们只是需要喘口气
We just needed a little break.

104
00:04:49,930 --> 00:04:51,190
我理解
Yeah, I get that.

105
00:04:51,190 --> 00:04:52,710
我那天送漫画去给他的时候
When I brought him his comics the other day,

106
00:04:52,710 --> 00:04:56,140
他说"靠  索命鬼真的来了"
he said, "Oh, great, Death is literally at my door."

107
00:04:57,900 --> 00:04:59,350
他对每个人都是这么贱
He was being a jerk to everyone.

108
00:04:59,350 --> 00:05:00,700
你别往心里去
Don't take it personally.

109
00:05:00,700 --> 00:05:02,650
我吃着无数种抗抑郁药
Oh, I'm on so many antidepressants,

110
00:05:02,650 --> 00:05:04,630
我就是想难过都没办法
I couldn't if I wanted to.

111
00:05:06,780 --> 00:05:09,770
真希望我们能甩开谢尔顿做更多事
I wish we could do more stuff without Sheldon.

112
00:05:09,770 --> 00:05:11,850
我一直这么真心希望
I wish that all the time.

113
00:05:12,390 --> 00:05:15,350
通常都是在我吹熄生日蛋糕之前
Usually before I blow out birthday candles.

114
00:05:16,710 --> 00:05:19,440
艾米就甩开他休息了一阵子啊
You know, Amy took some time off from him.

115
00:05:19,440 --> 00:05:21,780
感情还因此提升了不少
Really improved their relationship.

116
00:05:22,350 --> 00:05:23,250
行
Okay.

117
00:05:23,250 --> 00:05:25,800
只要最后我们不需要跟他滚床单
As long as it doesn't end with us having coitus with him,

118
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,970
我就加入
I'm in.

119
00:05:28,300 --> 00:05:30,620
我们应该一起去旅游之类的
We should all take a trip or something.

120
00:05:30,620 --> 00:05:32,220
我跟佩妮谈过
You know, Penny and I have been talking

121
00:05:32,220 --> 00:05:33,560
找个周末去赌城玩
about taking a weekend in Vegas.

122
00:05:33,560 --> 00:05:34,980
或许我们大伙应该一起去
Maybe we should all go.

123
00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:36,190
妮妮肯定想去
Bernie would love that.

124
00:05:36,800 --> 00:05:39,630
或许我们可以叫台派对巴士载我们去
Maybe we could get one of those party buses to take us there.

125
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:40,710
听起来就很有意思
That sounds really fun.

126
00:05:40,710 --> 00:05:41,730
绝对有意思
Yeah, that sounds fun.

127
00:05:41,730 --> 00:05:43,970
派对巴  派对趴
A party-bus party don't stop.

128
00:05:44,420 --> 00:05:46,650
我说"派对"  你说"巴"
When I say "party," you say "bus."

129
00:05:46,650 --> 00:05:47,470
-不  -不
- No. - No.

130
00:05:47,480 --> 00:05:48,900
-不  -不
- No. - No!

131
00:05:51,630 --> 00:05:53,280
今天我们几个男的在讨论
So, the guys and I were talking about

132
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:55,600
租一台派对巴士  大家一起去赌城玩
renting a party bus and everyone going to Vegas.

133
00:05:55,600 --> 00:05:57,420
感觉应该挺有意思
Oh, that could be fun.

134
00:05:57,420 --> 00:05:59,280
但我先问清楚  你说派对巴士
But just to be clear, you mean a party bus

135
00:05:59,280 --> 00:06:00,810
是指有酒跟音乐的那种吧
with booze and music, right,

136
00:06:00,810 --> 00:06:03,140
不是盒装果汁搭配游戏机
not, like, juice boxes and video games?

137
00:06:04,110 --> 00:06:05,200
是啦
Yes.

138
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:07,170
上次霍华德的生日趴是送孩子去玩的那种
And Howard's birthday was a drop-off party.

139
00:06:07,170 --> 00:06:08,880
你这"家长"明明不用留下的
You didn't have to stay.

140
00:06:10,390 --> 00:06:11,320
那我加入
Well, I'm in.

141
00:06:11,320 --> 00:06:12,860
-我们什么时候出发  -这周末
- When are we going? - This weekend.

142
00:06:12,860 --> 00:06:14,870
我们要去哪里玩啊
Oh, where are we going?

143
00:06:15,490 --> 00:06:17,010
赌城  但是...
Well, Vegas, but...

144
00:06:17,010 --> 00:06:19,450
没有特产太妃糖的大西洋城[也是赌城]吗
Ugh, Atlantic City without the taffy?

145
00:06:19,450 --> 00:06:20,990
我可不想去
No, thank you.

146
00:06:21,910 --> 00:06:23,970
没关系  其实也没有要邀请你
That's fine, 'cause actually you're not invited.

147
00:06:23,970 --> 00:06:26,060
真的假的  太伤人了
Well, now... well, that's hurtful.

148
00:06:26,060 --> 00:06:28,100
谢尔顿  你根本不喜欢那地方
Oh, Sheldon, you don't even like it there.

149
00:06:28,100 --> 00:06:30,780
我能把一个地方看做小便池里的芳香剂
I can consider a place America's urinal cake

150
00:06:30,780 --> 00:06:33,180
但我去的时候也还是尿得享受啊
and still enjoy the occasional visit.

151
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:35,300
这次不行
Not this time.

152
00:06:35,300 --> 00:06:38,090
算了  那我跟沃罗威茨玩吧
Oh, fine. Then I'll just hang out with Wolowitz.

153
00:06:38,090 --> 00:06:39,060
他也去
He's coming, too.

154
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:41,480
-那我和拉杰...  -他也去
- Well, then Raj and I will... - Nope.

155
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,330
很好  那我找斯图尔特
Very well. Stuart.

156
00:06:43,330 --> 00:06:44,830
好呀  去吧
Oh, great. Do that.

157
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:48,390
恶  斯图尔特
Ugh. Stuart.

158
00:06:50,330 --> 00:06:52,110
谢尔顿  有啥新鲜事吗
Hi, Sheldon. What's new?

159
00:06:52,110 --> 00:06:54,650
我们的朋友是混蛋  我气他们所有人
Our friends are jerks, and I'm mad at all of them.

160
00:06:54,650 --> 00:06:57,010
我是问"有啥新鲜事"  不过算了
I said, "What's new?" but sure.

161
00:06:58,260 --> 00:06:59,420
你能相信他们打算组团去
Can you believe they planned a trip

162
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:01,730
赌城玩却不邀请我吗
to Las Vegas and didn't invite me?

163
00:07:01,730 --> 00:07:03,330
你是不是拒绝道歉
Did you refuse to apologize

164
00:07:03,330 --> 00:07:06,250
还表现得他们生气是愚蠢的表现呀
and act like they were stupid for being mad?

165
00:07:07,200 --> 00:07:08,620
我更喜欢我们之前的感情
You know, I liked it better when there was still

166
00:07:08,620 --> 00:07:11,250
留有一丝丝神秘感
a little mystery left in our relationship.

167
00:07:11,990 --> 00:07:13,860
大家都努力去照顾你
Everyone tried to take care of you,

168
00:07:13,860 --> 00:07:16,060
而你只会对他们毒舌嫌弃
and you were nothing but mean to them.

169
00:07:16,060 --> 00:07:18,090
真不敢相信你居然不站我这边
I can't believe you're not on my side.

170
00:07:18,090 --> 00:07:22,260
有人偷了你的汽车音响时  我可是站你这边
I was on your side when someone stole your car radio.

171
00:07:23,420 --> 00:07:26,450
你不站我这边  你还能站谁那边啊
Who else's side could you have been on?

172
00:07:27,090 --> 00:07:28,580
难说啊
I don't know.

173
00:07:28,580 --> 00:07:31,530
说不定窃贼是个热爱音乐的高尚流浪汉
A music-loving hobo with a heart of gold?

174
00:07:32,630 --> 00:07:35,250
谢尔顿  我理解你不高兴
Sheldon, I understand that you're upset

175
00:07:35,250 --> 00:07:36,540
因为觉得自己被孤立
because you feel left out,

176
00:07:36,540 --> 00:07:39,080
但我不明白这事有啥好浪费时间讨论
but I don't know why we're even talking about this.

177
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:41,100
去跟他们道歉就对了
Just apologize to them.

178
00:07:41,100 --> 00:07:44,190
如果要这样才能加入他们的白痴之旅  那行吧
Fine, if that's what it takes to go on their dumb trip.

179
00:07:44,190 --> 00:07:45,800
或许你可以试着
Maybe you could try apologizing

180
00:07:45,800 --> 00:07:48,220
真的因为觉得内疚而道歉
