现在试试像个正常人一样讲话
Now try it as if this isn't your first day as a person.

188
00:08:07,220 --> 00:08:08,490
行
Fine.

189
00:08:08,490 --> 00:08:11,690
莱纳德为我煮汤  我却嫌东嫌西
Leonard made me soup, and I was mean to him.

190
00:08:12,320 --> 00:08:14,690
哎哟  我有点感觉了
Hey, I felt a little something.

191
00:08:14,690 --> 00:08:16,340
