307
00:13:14,850 --> 00:13:17,250
现在  你何不接受我的道歉
Now, why don't you accept my apology,

308
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:19,110
拿上你的免费T恤
receive your free T-shirt, uh--

309
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:21,560
特小号应该合适你吧
I hope extra small is okay.

310
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:24,070
不知道为啥沃罗维兹把中号拿走了
For some reason Wolowitz took a medium.

311
00:13:26,290 --> 00:13:29,050
我不接受你的道歉
Well, I don't accept your apology.

312
00:13:29,050 --> 00:13:29,890
你这是干什么呢
What are you doing?

313
00:13:29,890 --> 00:13:31,610
这叫做为自己出头
It's called standing up for myself.

314
00:13:31,610 --> 00:13:33,390
你偶尔也应该试试
You should try it some time.

315
00:13:33,790 --> 00:13:35,580
好吧  那这样如何
Fine, how about this?

316
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:37,050
你拉长了这场无聊的争执
You're making me uncomfortable

317
