你希望我不要再闹了吗
Oh, you want me to stop?

320
00:13:41,930 --> 00:13:43,080
没问题
No problem.

321
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,700
别这样  你别走啊
No, come on, please don't leave!

322
00:13:45,120 --> 00:13:47,400
我想搞清楚  你还会去旅行吗
Point of clarification-- are you still going on the trip?

323
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,040
如果你不去的话...
Because if not...

324
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,790
别担心  你可以去
Don't worry, you're good.

325
00:13:53,280 --> 00:13:55,900
是我引起了这场争吵  我觉得好内疚
I caused that fight, I feel terrible.

326
00:13:56,260 --> 00:13:57,850
等等等等  我还可以演得更好...
Wait, I can do that better...

327
00:14:00,550 --> 00:14:01,930
是我引起了这场争吵
I caused that fight.

328
00:14:01,930 --> 00:14:03,550
人家觉得好内疚
I feel terrible.

329
00:14:03,550 --> 00:14:05,900
我自己都分不清哪个演法更出色了
Yeah, wow, I don't know which one I like more.

330
00:14:08,290 --> 00:14:10,180
他们吵得很糟糕吗
So, was the fight really bad?

331
00:14:10,470 --> 00:14:11,190
不
No.

332
00:14:11,190 --> 00:14:13,000
作为一场争吵  那真是恰到好处
As a fight, it was excellent.

333
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:16,180
她言辞激烈  摔门而去
She used harsh language and slammed the door.

334
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:17,430
虽然我也同时反应过来
Although as I say this,

335
00:14:17,430 --> 00:14:20,170
你问的估计不是这个意思
that might not have been what you were asking.

336
00:14:21,090 --> 00:14:22,620
他们还会去旅行吗
You think they'll still go on the trip?

337
00:14:22,620 --> 00:14:25,170
我只知道我为了平息这场争吵去了艾米丽家...
All I know is after the fight I went to Emily's to smooth...

338
00:14:25,170 --> 00:14:27,070
-他们不会去了吧  -是的
- They're not going on the trip. - No.

339
00:14:29,890 --> 00:14:31,500
你这人到底什么毛病
What is wrong with you?

340
00:14:31,830 --> 00:14:35,200
看看他  如此关心我有什么毛病
Look at him, caring about what's wrong with me.

341
00:14:35,200 --> 00:14:37,710
这真是一等一的同理心啊
That is some top-shelf empathy.

342
00:14:39,070 --> 00:14:40,940
我们应该组成一个俱乐部
Hey, well, we should start a club.

343
00:14:42,760 --> 00:14:45,160
你去艾米丽家道歉
You went to Emily's to apologize.

344
