等你走了以后  她就哭了
And when you left, she was crying.

345
00:14:47,510 --> 00:14:49,190
这是真的
That is true.

346
00:14:49,280 --> 00:14:50,950
我想我应该再道歉一次了
Well, I suppose I should apologize again.

347
00:14:53,670 --> 00:14:54,920
她没事吧
Is she okay?

348
00:14:54,920 --> 00:14:57,160
没事  我安抚了她
Yeah, I calmed her down.

349
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:59,720
但如果谢尔顿去赌城  她就不去了
But she's not going to Vegas if he's going.

350
00:14:59,720 --> 00:15:01,010
等等  还有这个选项吗
Wait, that's an option?

351
00:15:01,010 --> 00:15:03,220
我都不知道还有这个选项
I didn't know that was an option.

352
00:15:03,970 --> 00:15:06,170
没关系  因为我决定
Well, that is fine, because I've decided

353
00:15:06,170 --> 00:15:07,440
我不和你们去旅行了
that I won't be joining you.

354
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:09,650
因为我意识到最能表达
I've realized that the most genuine way

355
00:15:09,650 --> 00:15:11,950
我的歉意的方式
to demonstrate the remorse I feel is

356
00:15:11,950 --> 00:15:14,740
就是让你们自己好好享受这个周末
to let you have this weekend to yourselves.

357
00:15:15,690 --> 00:15:17,250
你真成熟大度
That's very mature of you.

358
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:19,830
我自己最近也正在进行一段旅行
Well, I've been on a little trip myself recently.

